## How to amend

A new decision gets the next id (D-38 …). A changed decision keeps its id, moves to
`superseded`, and a new id states the replacement. Never edit a row's words after Zee has
confirmed it. Run `bun .claude/skills/acos-skill-maker/scripts/trace.ts check <TRACE.json>`
after any change — an unmapped active id fails the gate.

